<title>HONG KONG: HK land auction - Mui Wo site goes for HK$10 mln.</title>
<headline>HK land auction - Mui Wo site goes for HK$10 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 720-square-metre site in Mui Wo on outlying Lantau Island sold for HK$10 million at a Hong Kong government land auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The plot had been expected to fetch between HK$12 million and HK$27 million, property analysts said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
